sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant Browser
    participant Server
    participant Database as SQLite
    Note over Server,Database: Setup: CSV importer writes courses in one transaction
    Student->>Browser: Open planner
    Browser->>Server: GET / and /assets/*
    Server-->>Browser: HTML, CSS and JavaScript
    Browser->>Server: GET /api/courses
    Server->>Database: SELECT courses joined with subjects
    Database-->>Server: Course rows
    Server-->>Browser: Course catalogue as JSON
    Browser->>Browser: Read localStorage; validate saved course IDs
    Browser-->>Student: Show catalogue and saved or empty plan
    Student->>Browser: Add, move or remove a course
    Browser->>Browser: Update plan, hints and credit totals
    Browser->>Browser: Save versioned plan JSON to localStorage
    Browser-->>Student: Redraw grid and course details
    Note over Student,Browser: Export and import use JSON files; no plan API request
    Note over Server,Database: Server plan CRUD routes exist and are tested separately
